  <item>
    <title>Vol. 35 熊的瑞典见闻录（下）：Herräng &amp; Heedman 大不同</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694cec02946dca0925475489</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694cec02946dca0925475489</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Dec 2025 08:24:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目承接上一期熊的故事，在结束Herrang的学习体验之后，她前往了同在瑞典的Heedman Camp，两个舞蹈活动很有渊源，但是非常不同，借着这些体验，我们也聊了一些有关身份、文化和政治口号的事，这些内容总体并不轻松，但是不乏趣味，还有局部十分搞笑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">1:09</a> Heedman和Herrang不同的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a> Herrang比Heedman更卷也更有压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">6:31</a> 交朋友非得要small talk吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">9:03</a> 更political的Herrang</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> 我们可能不太习惯getting political</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> being political会带来的不舒适</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 个人的就是政治的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 以具体为方法论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 该如何尊重一种不属于自己民族的文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 不舒适可以触发对话与理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 参加Heedman相关的不安与焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 一个英语不好的亚裔舞者眼中的Herrang种族争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> 在Heedman Camp中处处有Frankie的影子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a> 激情安利老电影《Stormy Weather》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a> 熊想成为什么样的摇摆舞者？（没有答案）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2771">46:11</a> 熊推荐歌曲的背后故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tea For Two by Johnny Maddox</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rico Vacilón by Rubén González</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：马&amp;熊</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信/微博/小红书：猫角工作室</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62f0c9f9e340075578cf77eb/lgyQRVv1s2GdXnyqNmEgHQRiTixu.m4a" length="54978805" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp39wD9qKRMkBCESC9GCsZQ8B-Xn.png"/>
