  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 34 夏天将尽时，熊的瑞典见闻录</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d0cc1da56ca3e0c49eb3c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d0cc1da56ca3e0c49eb3c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 04:42:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>熊是只摇摆老猫，她是今年STB教师访谈的前线记者。或许是因为名字，或许也是因为她安静而沉稳的存在 (比起很多吵闹的人)，她总让我想到塔罗牌里的力量牌。今年夏天，她先后前往Herräng和Heedman Camp学习、游历、拖地、说英语、做咖啡、聊政治、休闲、尽情跳slow......总之做了好多事。夏天快结束的时候，她主动要求录制她的所见所闻，由于内容实在很丰富，所以她的瑞典之行将分为两期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlP75UTGKbYlX3zfI8_TsEC6T0ig.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 主播不会读“属于摇摆舞舞者”这七个字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">1:29</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a> Herräng在瑞典语到底咋念（我念得不对）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">2:54</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">4:58</a> &nbsp;熊、马，名字和记忆，熊久远的别名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">4:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">8:21</a> 熊摇摆舞的起点，兔子舞，其他成为历史的名字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">8:22</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">9:39</a> 更多名字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">9:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> "我从来没有意识到我喜欢摇摆舞" 一切都是后知后觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 熊，你为何起舞？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> 两次去Herrang心态的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 申请那些事儿只要你想去的话其实都不是事儿但是我们还是介绍一下吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 申请志愿者需要申报的特别技能（？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 咖啡厅志愿者熊上岗，熊在Herrang的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 课程新体验、新收获，感受与猫角不同的课程关注</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 令熊很害怕的严肃女教师 Fatima</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a> 聊舞者生活和英语：在错中学，开口才是最重要的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2047">34:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a> 练习英语和进入舞池之间的非常不准确的比喻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> STB人物专访负责人的工作内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2234">37:14</a> 作为新老师，身份转变让熊的舞者生活产生了微妙的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> 到底是老师还是同学？其实舒服的互动不一定有绝对方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">42:58</a> 浓人淡人都可以在社群里有自己的位置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2656">44:16</a> 聊布朗尼表演、熊在猫角其他的存在方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">44:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 在Herrang的另一种表演文化：即兴、玩儿、“糊逼”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3212">53:32</a> 把自己全然交给当下需要些安全感，这种交付是美妙而必要的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3213">53:33</a> 熊的Herrang舞会体验，Fredrik说le不给fo空间是一个世界级问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a> 熊的Herrang舞会幸福时刻</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62f0c9f9e340075578cf77eb/lkmaJOZoVJkU8IC2jOOV5pex9OeE.m4a" length="59509976" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frsrf8dPHy7eMmqpn9fSggA_5tQ9.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 33 夏天开始前，重重的重重心事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b4580b5faf36865951cf87</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b4580b5faf36865951cf87</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Aug 2025 14:22:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>重重是猫角接话大王，他为人亲和且说话无厘头，发型总是在光头和浪漫的羊毛卷之间轮回，在众多猫角周六舞会的open satge的主持人中，我一直觉得他是最松弛的一位，可能因为他真的想到哪就说到哪。和他聊天的初衷，是好奇他在成为新教师之前，在猫角那种游离但总会回来的状态，不过毕竟是和他聊天，想问的似乎自然而然地不能算是个问题，想听的莫名其妙地变成了意料之外的精彩，使用大纲对谈反而变得笨拙......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">0:01</a> 重重的开机音效</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">1:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">4:22</a> 有人离开摇摆舞，有人回到摇摆舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">4:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">4:38</a> 重重：离开是种心态，没跳舞不算离开摇摆舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">4:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">5:40</a> 努力向重重解释我到底在说什么（不是很成功）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">5:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">6:09</a> 跳久了以后舞会和回家躺着会成为竞争选项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">6:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">8:30</a> 回来跳舞的动机：同辈既是压力也是鼓舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">8:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 故事的开始：曾威铭接受人物杂志采访</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 在海淀学跳舞的意味着什么样的研究生生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 两人就大学生的学舞成本高低完全没有达成共识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">12:08</a> 和重重再次美妙地说岔劈了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 重重的猫角学艺时代和重要免责声明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 时代切片：猫角曾经的课程体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="814">13:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a> 猫角以外的舞会时光、很少被提起的老场地名字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 慌乱地忘记了要说什么1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 职业生活的痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> 另一个答案：决策成本低，就总会飘回来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 重重，你到底是什么样的男子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> 重重，你小时候什么样的男子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 慌乱地忘记了要说什么2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 重重，接话大王懵懵懂懂长大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 曾经觉得，努力是件很羞耻的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 重重想成为什么样的摇摆舞舞者，比赛观念及恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 为何想要成为教师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 另一种看待竞争的角度：其实需要看到他人，需要刺激</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 重重不接受我的解读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a> 重重的立场出现松动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> 再次尝试理解竞争，从Ryan讲述的角度，爵士可能需要点狠劲儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> 评价，言语，误读，不可避免的微妙竞争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">36:22</a> 围绕路过的猫展开了一点闲聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 重重向主播很随意地提问了一个问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2291">38:11</a> 恍惚间新人舞会已换了天地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2424">40:24</a> 社群代际的替换，社群代际间的凝聚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a> 暴露了这档播客录制于四个月前的恐怖事实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> 重重名字的由来、猫角电箱的lore</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpXB1CpBMPJQwVGTWMjS_-iB4W1Y.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;此gif的credit goes to 潇潇，also欢迎大家加入周日tap练习</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>开篇：I'm beginning to see the light.</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：Gravity-Coldplay</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：重重&amp;🐎</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信/微博/小红书：猫角工作室</span></p>]]></description>
