  <item>
    <title>Vol.30 和王老太太唠STB新人赛夺冠和其他家常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6783350dd6a4b57e147df4ee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6783350dd6a4b57e147df4ee</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jan 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>王慧莲是一位职业小提琴手，也大概率是猫角笑声最响的人，平时喜欢以grandma自居。在这期大呼小叫的家常聊天中，王老太主要分享了自由随性的爵士态度，顺便谈了些不乏勤勉的成长秘辛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>［时间轴］</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">3:10</a> 新人赛编舞时在想什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">6:30</a> 不同的音乐，不同的出发点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> 在solo决赛的舞台上不想看评委</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 老王的摇摆舞者生涯起点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 误打误撞开始lindy hop</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a> 王女士调查家里发出的异响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 持续学习摇摆舞的动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1368">22:48</a> STB新人赛的都市传说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 比赛vs日常的不同状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 被凶恶的舞伴向泽帆威胁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 舞者与乐手的形象反差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 老王的小提琴手生涯起点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> 老王再次去教训她的猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 二线城市工薪家庭接受音乐教育的经济账</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">33:53</a> 幼年王老太的文艺生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2128">35:28</a> 聊小学音乐课记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 老王的快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2374">39:34</a> 乐手经历对舞蹈学习的帮助</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 老王是什么样的小提琴老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 老王与吉普赛爵士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">44:20</a> 老王无法对吉普赛爵士进行有效科普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 我想故我做一切</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 我想故我舞会DJ”怪歌“并被Joy骂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3204">53:24</a> 咖啡馆主理人的时间管理（不管）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3343">55:43</a> 摇摆舞对生活的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期涉及摇摆词汇：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.摇摆舞：是20世纪20年代至 40年代随着爵士乐的摇摆风格而发展起来的一组舞蹈类型的统称，每一种舞蹈的起源都早于通常所说的“摇摆时代”。在摇摆时代，有几百种不同风格的摇摆舞，经过不断的融合与发展，目前主要有：林迪舞（Lindy Hop）、巴尔博亚舞（Balboa）、Shag、查尔斯顿舞（Charleston）等；</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>开篇：Frolic Sam -Barney Bigard &amp; His Jazzopators</span></p><span></span><p><span>快问快答：牧童短笛 - 郎朗</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：Sonate Pacifique - L'Impératrice</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：马&amp;老王</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信/微博/小红书：猫角工作室</span></p>]]></description>
