    <title>Vol.29 走进猫角三好学生Sophie的人生笔记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e3e8aa5ca6d0ace3ab8a02</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e3e8aa5ca6d0ace3ab8a02</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 07:24:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Sophie是猫角最勤奋，也是成长最明显的舞者之一，00后的她看起来总有一种与超越年龄的持重，这或许与她的经历与思考密不可分......</span></p><span></span><p><span>［时间轴］</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">04:18</a> Sophie的猫角初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="334">05:34</a> 玄学大师Lis对Sophie的铁口直断</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a> 跳舞的快乐有很多层次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> Sophie的榜样是?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a> "我太喜欢lindy了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1606">26:46</a> 跳摇摆舞遇到的大坎儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> "我把雅思想象成猫角毕业考试"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a> 扎扎实实才能突破瓶颈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1963">32:43</a> 觉得自己对摇摆舞开窍了的moments</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> 和Chester聊天是什么体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 表演者的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2559">42:39</a> 摇摆舞是对抗习得性无助的最好方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2774">46:14</a> Sophie's Goodbye</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a> Sophie的90秒快问快答</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期涉及摇摆词汇：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.摇摆舞：是20世纪20年代至 40年代随着爵士乐的摇摆风格而发展起来的一组舞蹈类型的统称，每一种舞蹈的起源都早于通常所说的“摇摆时代”。在摇摆时代，有几百种不同风格的摇摆舞，经过不断的融合与发展，目前主要有：林迪舞（Lindy Hop）、巴尔博亚舞（Balboa）、Shag、查尔斯顿舞（Charleston）等；</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>开篇：I'm Beginning to See the Light</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：Coleman Hawkins - Wrap Up Your Troubles in Dreams</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：马&amp;Sophie</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信/微博/小红书：猫角工作室</span></p>]]></description>
